IndexOfModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Returns the index of the first occurrence of a value in a list, or -1. A CFG and block-order utility.
    Provides: IndexOf(lst, val) -> res. returns the index of val in lst or -1.
    DependsOn: none (leaf; Core.ListGet/Eq/Ge, Loop).
    Composition: Native include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../IndexOf/IndexOf.sir).
    Notes: used by NextInOrder to locate a block position in state["order"].
